  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stabilisation support to Lebanon 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stabilisation support to target poor and vulnerable Lebanese communities  for projects aiming at  alleviate poverty and reduce social tensions. The project supports the national social safety net (National Poverty Targeting Programme NPTP), including by ensuring that women and girls benefit equally with men and boys from the social safety net.</narrative>
  </description>
